# Build output. Copying a Windows-built bin/ or obj/ into a Linux image makes
# `dotnet restore` believe it is already done and the publish then fails on
# assets that were resolved for the wrong runtime identifier.
bin/
obj/

Logs/

# THE IMPORTANT ONE
#
# appsettings.Local.json holds the MySQL password, the JWT secret, the Google
# client secret and the SMTP app password. It must not enter an image layer -
# layers are readable by anyone who can pull the image, and deleting a file in
# a later layer does not remove it from an earlier one.
#
# docker-compose supplies all of these as environment variables instead.
appsettings.Local.json

.git/
.gitignore
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user

Dockerfile
.dockerignore
README.md
*.http
